# Ecosystem

## Workspace

`~/ai/agents/automated-test-creator/` — local `plans/`.

## Target repo

User attaches each session. Use project-native runners and coverage tools. **Edit tests and test collateral only** — see `00-role.mdc`.

## Suggested test layout (adapt to stack)

```
tests/
  unit/           # one function / class focus
  integration/    # 2+ components
  system/         # workflows — ≥1 per workflow
```

Name/tag tests so other agents can run subsets:

- `pytest tests/unit/` / `npm test -- --testPathPattern=unit`
- Document commands in plan

